==Locations and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Frozen Foods are a type of [[Food]] created by dropping meat [[Material]]s in a [[Freezing Climate]] or [[Cold Water]].<ref name="BotW Piggyback"/><ref name="BotW Tips and Tricks"/> They can also be made by striking the Materials with [[Ice Arrow]]s, a [[Frostblade]], a [[Great Frostblade]], or a [[Frostspear]]. While the amount of [[Heart]]s they restore to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]] does not change, they grant one level of [[Heat Resistance]] when they are eaten.<ref name="BotW Piggyback"/> Unlike [[Meal]]s created in a [[Cooking Pot]], Frozen Foods stack in Link's [[Inventory]].

